        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"8e9a5751-c1e8-4d7a-afbe-5239c98a08d0\",\"review_text\":\"Shame on you 😡 😡😠😠😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"f7cc1aa7-c306-4f5b-a5e9-911cca07fa60\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this application 😡😡😡bakwas\"},{\"review_id\":\"f1532a7d-a47c-40eb-b41f-da17a379f9fb\",\"review_text\":\"Hateful app Waste of time\"},{\"review_id\":\"e85a31f6-786e-4673-94b8-010fea8ce464\",\"review_text\":\"I love the mixes\"},{\"review_id\":\"a7b7539a-c8d3-4f4e-9edd-d46cd1b1fd12\",\"review_text\":\"The very second I signed up for premium it stopped letting me play anything.. lol . Fastest cancelation of a service I've done, ever. Bye bye Spotify. Hello old friend, Bittorrent\"},{\"review_id\":\"7a8b5434-66b4-4b13-aa91-5ad62a86ec04\",\"review_text\":\"I love sportify. This is number one music app for me and others.\"},{\"review_id\":\"5e42046c-b29b-4035-ba83-a8e222789e98\",\"review_text\":\"Listen to my music almost everyday,this app is great. But the bad thing is that it gives too many ads, i would have hiven it 5 stars. Apart from that this app is great\"},{\"review_id\":\"8f0071a2-190f-4e20-bec3-3f252e47a6e3\",\"review_text\":\"It's good\"},{\"review_id\":\"0575ce08-ab04-46f0-aa8a-fbf9cd27e8da\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this application .. 👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"2313bd8e-43bd-4777-bff9-3ae753288f0e\",\"review_text\":\"It is absolutely useless after the latest update. There's nothing I can do without the \\\"try premium\\\" option popping up every damn time.\"}]}"
